      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Landmark Riverside Residence in the Heart of Kilkenny:\r\nFitzGerald's are delighted to offer an exceptional A1-rated architect-designed residence extending to to approximately 298.3m² (3,210 sq. ft.) of luxurious living accommodation, complemented by a substantial detached double garage of approximately 60.3 m² (649 sq. ft.), occupying a magnificent private riverside setting with direct access to the Canal Walk and just moments from Kilkenny Castle and the vibrant city centre.\r\n\r\nContemporary Luxury Without Compromise:\r\nBehind remote-controlled electric entrance gates, De Clare House offers a level of quality, design and finish rarely available on the Irish market.\r\nEvery aspect of this remarkable home has been thoughtfully designed to create a luxurious lifestyle, combining striking contemporary architecture with exceptional craftsmanship, premium materials and intelligent design.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Kilkenny's most desirable residential settings, the property enjoys direct private access onto the Canal Walk, allowing residents to stroll beside the River Nore to Kilkenny Castle, John's Bridge and the heart of Kilkenny City without ever stepping onto the main road.\r\n\r\nThe Master Suite:\r\nOccupying its own private level, the magnificent master suite has been designed as a peaceful sanctuary.\r\nThe suite comprises a luxurious bedroom, a bespoke fitted wardrobe, an elegant private ensuite, a dedicated home office and a private balcony overlooking the River Nore.\r\nWhether enjoying your morning coffee overlooking the river or relaxing in the evening while taking in the lights of Kilkenny, this private retreat offers a lifestyle rarely found within walking distance of a city centre.\r\n\r\nOutdoor Living:\r\nDesigned for entertaining on a grand scale, the rear of the property features an impressive approximately 110m² south-facing granite patio, creating a seamless extension of the living space.\r\nWith generous seating and entertaining areas, including a stylish gazebo, it provides the perfect setting for outdoor dining, family gatherings or simply relaxing in complete privacy.\r\nThe south-facing orientation allows sunlight to pour into the home throughout the day through the impressive 3.5m wide sliding glass doors, filling the kitchen\r\n\r\nAccommodation: \r\nGround Floor:\r\nRemote-controlled electric entrance gates with mobile phone intercom access.\r\nDetached double garage with remote-controlled electric roller doors.\r\nIntegrated wall box electric vehicle charging point.\r\nFully equipped private home gym.\r\nLuxury sauna with adjoining shower facilities.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nDesigner open-plan kitchen, dining and family living area.\r\nElegant reception room with feature fireplace.\r\nApproximately 110m² south-facing granite entertaining patio, complete with generous outdoor entertaining areas and gazebo.\r\nLarge 3.5m sliding glass doors, flooding the home with natural light throughout the day.\r\nLandscaped private gardens extending to approximately 0.49 acres.\r\n\r\nSecond Floor:\r\nMagnificent master suite incorporating a luxurious bedroom, bespoke fitted wardrobe, elegant private ensuite, dedicated home office.\r\nPrivate balcony overlooking the River Nore and the evening lights of Kilkenny.\r\n\r\nViewings are strictly by appointment only by contacting our office on 056 777 0 888."
